BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:network:30g9s6703bhvace5266q24ejiq_R20260806T170000@google.com-2026-11
 -05T18:00:00.000Z
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20261029T051842Z
DTSTART:20261105T180000Z
DTEND:20261105T190000Z
SUMMARY:All-Campus Virtual OSPO Meetup
DESCRIPTION:Thinking about open-sourcing your research software but unsure
  how to approach your Tech Transfer Office (TTO)? Steven Tudor\, Director 
 of the Technology Transfer Office at UC Davis\, and Mike Cohen\, Director 
 of Innovation Ecosystem Development in UC Berkeley's TTO\, join us to talk
  about what their offices actually do when a researcher wants to release c
 ode as open source\, the worries researchers bring to them most often\, an
 d what information the TTO needs to help researchers make decisions. We'll
  also talk about how your campus OSPO can serve as a first stop on the way
  to tech transfer\, so you can feel informed and confident when you meet w
 ith the TTO.\n\nGuest speakers:\n\n- Steven Tudor is Director of the TTO a
 t UC Davis\, where he leads the university’s intellectual property manag
 ement and commercialization activities. His work focuses on helping resear
 chers navigate intellectual property\, licensing\, and commercialization w
 hile supporting practical pathways for moving university innovations into 
 broader use.\n- Mike Cohen is Director of Innovation Ecosystem Development
  in UC Berkeley's TTO\, where he drives initiatives and license agreements
  that catalyze the commercialization of UC Berkeley innovations and suppor
 t the funding of campus research. In 2019\, he led the development of UC B
 erkeley's Open Source Software Startup (OS3) Good-Standing Program\, which
  enables the university to obtain stock equity in startups that spin out o
 f the university leveraging software developed at\, and open-sourced by\, 
 the university.\nStudents\, staff\, faculty\, researchers\, and folks outs
 ide UC all welcome!\nRegister here: https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/98527182449
 ?pwd=PMdoVaOTSYuAHqPVWQbYPGHOmGrb5o.1
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/98527182449?pwd=PMdoVaOTSYuAHqPVWQ
 bYPGHOmGrb5o.1
END:VEVENT
