SUMMARY:OSPO Network Alignment Group Meeting
DESCRIPTION:https://ucsb.zoom.us/j/87582153282\n\nThe UC OSPO Network Alig
 nment Group Alignment Group brings together the chairs and delegates of th
 e Network's Working Groups to coordinate cross-cutting work and keep the g
 roups aligned as the Network's governance takes shape. Meetings are open t
 o anyone in the UC open source community. Working-group delegates are aske
 d to attend\, and everyone else is welcome to join and listen in. Learn mo
 re at ucospo.net.\n \nAlignment Group running notes doc
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ucsb.zoom.us/j/87582153282
END:VEVENT
